    "revisionIds": ["93397199"],
    "language": "Japanese",
    "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"Etymology_2\">Etymology</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wasei_kango\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Wasei kango\">Wasei kango</a>, created as a translation of English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/telephone#English\" title=\"telephone\">telephone</a></i>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJc&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJc-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>  Coined in Japanese as a compound of Chinese-derived <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%BB#Japanese\" title=\"電\">電</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">den</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/electric\" title=\"electric\">electric</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> +&#8206; <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A9%B1#Japanese\" title=\"話\">話</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">wa</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/talking\" title=\"talking\">talking</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. See also <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A9%B1%E3%81%99#Japanese\" title=\"話す\">話す</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">hanasu</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to talk, to chat</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJc&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJc-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<p>First attested in a text from 1891.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJc&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJc-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Pronunciation_2\">Pronunciation</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Noun_2\">Noun</h3>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Jpan headword\" lang=\"ja\"><ruby>電<rp>(</rp><rt><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%A7%E3%82%93%E3%82%8F#Japanese\" title=\"でんわ\">でん</a></rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%A7%E3%82%93%E3%82%8F#Japanese\" title=\"でんわ\">わ</a></rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></strong> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Japanese_transliteration\" title=\"Wiktionary:Japanese transliteration\">•</a> (<span class=\"headword-tr tr\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/denwa#Japanese\" title=\"denwa\">denwa</a></span></span>)&#160;<i></i></span>\n</p>\n",
