  "ja-pan": {
    "word": "パン",
    "url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E3%83%91%E3%83%B3",
    "retrievedAt": "2026-11-10T12:29:02.979656+00:00",
    "revisionIds": ["92776501"],
    "language": "Japanese",
    "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"Etymology_1\">Etymology 1</h3>\n<p>From <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portuguese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Portuguese language\">Portuguese</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"pt\"><a href=\"/wiki/p%C3%A3o#Portuguese\" title=\"pão\">pão</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">bread</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJ&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJ-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DJR&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DJR-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Latin\">Latin</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\"><a href=\"/wiki/panem#Latin\" title=\"panem\">pānem</a></i>, <a href=\"/wiki/accusative\" title=\"accusative\">accusative</a> <a href=\"/wiki/singular\" title=\"singular\">singular</a> form of <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\"><a href=\"/wiki/panis#Latin\" title=\"panis\">pānis</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">bread</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. Compare <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:French language\">French</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\"><a href=\"/wiki/pain#French\" title=\"pain\">pain</a></i>, <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italian_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Italian language\">Italian</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\"><a href=\"/wiki/pane#Italian\" title=\"pane\">pane</a></i>, <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romanian_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Romanian language\">Romanian</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"ro\"><a href=\"/wiki/p%C3%A2ine#Romanian\" title=\"pâine\">pâine</a></i>, <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spanish_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Spanish language\">Spanish</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"es\"><a href=\"/wiki/pan#Spanish\" title=\"pan\">pan</a></i>.\n</p>\n<h4 id=\"Noun_2\">Noun</h4>\n\n<h3 id=\"Etymology_2\">Etymology 2</h3>\n<p>Borrowed from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:English language\">English</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/pan#English\" title=\"pan\">pan</a></i>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJ&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJ-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DJR&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DJR-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h4 id=\"Noun_3\">Noun</h4>\n",
