    "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable ja-see\" style=\"min-width:70%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>For pronunciation and definitions of <span lang=\"ja\" class=\"Jpan\">つなみ</span> – see the following entry.</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:var(--wikt-palette-white,#ffffff);color:inherit;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap;width:15%;vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><span lang=\"ja\" class=\"Jpan\">【<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%A5%E6%B3%A2#Japanese\" title=\"津波\">津波</a>】</span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"\">\n<dl><dd><span style=\"padding-right:.6em;color:var(--wikt-palette-darkgrey, #54595d);font-size:80%\">[noun]</span> <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style><span class=\"defdate\">[from early 1600s]</span> <span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/oceanography\" title=\"oceanography\">oceanography</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a <a href=\"/wiki/tsunami\" title=\"tsunami\">tsunami</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/tidal_wave\" title=\"tidal wave\">tidal wave</a></dd>\n<dd><span style=\"padding-right:.6em;color:var(--wikt-palette-darkgrey, #54595d);font-size:80%\">[noun]</span> <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%98%AF#Japanese\" title=\"海嘯\">海嘯</a></span>: <span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/hydrology\" title=\"hydrology\">hydrology</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#rare\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">rare</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a <a href=\"/wiki/tidal_bore\" title=\"tidal bore\">tidal bore</a></dd>\n<dd><span style=\"padding-right:.6em;color:var(--wikt-palette-darkgrey, #54595d);font-size:80%\">[noun]</span> <span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/hydrology\" title=\"hydrology\">hydrology</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#rare\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">rare</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a <a href=\"/wiki/storm_surge\" title=\"storm surge\">storm surge</a></dd>\n<dd><div style=\"background-color:var(--wikt-palette-cream,#f8f8f0);color:inherit;\"><span style=\"color:var(--wikt-palette-darkgrey, #54595d);font-size:80%\">Alternative spellings</span><br /><span style=\"margin-left:.8em\"><span lang=\"ja\" class=\"Jpan\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%A5%E6%B5%AA#Japanese\" title=\"津浪\">津浪</a></span>, <span lang=\"ja\" class=\"Jpan\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%98%AF#Japanese\" title=\"海嘯\">海嘯</a></span>, <span lang=\"ja\" class=\"Jpan\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%98%A8#Japanese\" title=\"海嘨\">海嘨</a></span></span></div></dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
