  "de-arbeit": {
    "word": "Arbeit",
    "url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Arbeit",
    "retrievedAt": "2026-11-10T12:29:14.950264+00:00",
    "revisionIds": ["94550332"],
    "language": "German",
    "html": "<h2 id=\"German\">German</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3>\n<p>From <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_High_German\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle High German\">Middle High German</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"gmh\"><a href=\"/wiki/arbeit#Middle_High_German\" title=\"arbeit\">arbeit</a></i>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_High_German\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Old High German\">Old High German</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"goh\"><a href=\"/wiki/arbeit#Old_High_German\" title=\"arbeit\">arbeit</a></i>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proto-West_Germanic_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Proto-West Germanic language\">Proto-West Germanic</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"gmw-pro\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-West_Germanic/arbai%C3%BEi\" title=\"Reconstruction:Proto-West Germanic/arbaiþi\">&#42;arbaiþi</a></i>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proto-Germanic_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Proto-Germanic language\">Proto-Germanic</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"gem-pro\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-Germanic/arbaidiz\" title=\"Reconstruction:Proto-Germanic/arbaidiz\">&#42;arbaidiz</a></i>, ultimately from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proto-Indo-European_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Proto-Indo-European language\">Proto-Indo-European</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"ine-pro\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-Indo-European/h%E2%82%83%C3%B3rb%CA%B0os\" title=\"Reconstruction:Proto-Indo-European/h₃órbʰos\">&#42;h₃órbʰos</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">orphan, servant, slave</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from which <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:English language\">English</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/orphan#English\" title=\"orphan\">orphan</a></i> is also derived. Cognate with <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yiddish\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Yiddish\">Yiddish</a></span> <i class=\"Hebr mention\" lang=\"yi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%D7%90%D6%B7%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%A2%D7%98#Yiddish\" title=\"אַרבעט\">אַרבעט</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"yi-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">arbet</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_English\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle English\">Middle English</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\"><a href=\"/wiki/arveth#Middle_English\" title=\"arveth\">arveth</a></i>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3>\n",
