    "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Jpan headword\" lang=\"ja\">テレビ</strong> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Japanese_transliteration\" title=\"Wiktionary:Japanese transliteration\">•</a> (<span class=\"headword-tr tr\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/terebi#Japanese\" title=\"terebi\">terebi</a></span></span>)&#160;<i></i></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#clipping\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">clipping</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%83%86%E3%83%AC%E3%83%93%E3%82%B8%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3#Japanese\" title=\"テレビジョン\"><b>テレビ</b>ジョン</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">terebijon</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/television\" title=\"television\">television</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></span></span>: a <a href=\"/wiki/TV\" title=\"TV\">TV</a></li></ol>",
