    "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3>\n<p>Compound of <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%A5#Japanese\" title=\"津\"><ruby>津<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>tsu</i></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/cove\" title=\"cove\">cove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/inlet\" title=\"inlet\">inlet</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/outlet\" title=\"outlet\">outlet</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> + <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A2#Japanese\" title=\"波\"><ruby>波<rp>(</rp><rt>なみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>nami</i></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/wave\" title=\"wave\">wave</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJ&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJ-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DJR&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DJR-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Named as such because tsunamis are more damaging to sea ports.\n</p><p>Attested since at least the <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E7%94%B2%E9%99%BD%E8%BB%8D%E9%91%91\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:ja:甲陽軍鑑\"><ruby>甲<rp>(</rp><rt>こう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>陽<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>軍<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>鑑<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dy%C5%8D_Gunkan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Kōyō Gunkan\">Kōyō Gunkan</a></i></i></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> of the early 1600s.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJ&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJ-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Jpan headword\" lang=\"ja\"><ruby>津<rp>(</rp><rt><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%BF#Japanese\" title=\"つなみ\">つ</a></rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>波<rp>(</rp><rt><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%BF#Japanese\" title=\"つなみ\">なみ</a></rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></strong> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Japanese_transliteration\" title=\"Wiktionary:Japanese transliteration\">•</a> (<span class=\"headword-tr tr\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/tsunami#Japanese\" title=\"tsunami\">tsunami</a></span></span>)&#160;<i></i></span>\n</p>",
